{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ms9VV2sTi21795124851.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>全球央行於9月份公開凈購金量61噸，創今年以來單月最高紀錄。</p><p></p><p>世界黃金協會的數據顯示，9月全球央行繼續增持黃金，公開凈購金量61噸，創2026年以來單月最高紀錄。波蘭和中國為購金主力，其他凈買家包括烏茲別克、哈薩克、約旦、捷克和玻利維亞。今年首9個月，全球央行公開凈購黃金228噸，較去年同期下跌百分之7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T22:44:18.327709+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T21:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.821519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T22:37:36.449930+00:00","content_hash":"dd2929987772a99bc7d610c1f9a20218be546e26b204d56a817df01c21e7aaf9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T22:44:18.327709+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}